# lfm2.5:8b at its full 128,000-token context.
#
# **Viable for the live bot. Not the analyst's model.** It was rejected
# outright on 2026-08-27 and the rejection no longer stands: every failure
# behind it was a defect in this app, and fixing those fixed the model. The
# full record is in ollama/README.md; the summary is below.
#
# It is the fastest model that has ever fit this hardware. Measured alone on an
# RX 6600 (8 GiB):
#
# | | `lfm2.5:8b` | `gemma4-e4b-qat-128k` |
# |---|---|---|
# | Prefill, 6.8k-token prompt | **2,138 tok/s** | 1,126 tok/s |
# | Generation | **107 tok/s** | 44 tok/s |
# | Layers on GPU | 25 of 25 | 43 of 43 |
# | VRAM at full context | 6.1 GiB | 3.7 GiB |
# | Mapped to host RAM | 205 MiB | 2,730 MiB |
#
# **It fabricated every price until three fixes landed the same day.** Two AAPL
# runs before, two after:
#
# | | Before | After |
# |---|---|---|
# | Structured-output failures | 4, 4 | **0, 0** |
# | Figures near the real close | 0 of 6, 0 of 3 | **7 of 9, 5 of 6** |
# | What it cited | $188-196, then $144-150 | 315.18 against a 315.20 close |
# | Market report | 532 and 0 chars | 5,319 and 4,358 chars |
# | Prompt share | 66%, 65% | 74%, 74% |
#
# The three fixes were `json_schema` structured output, removing every price
# field from `TraderProposal`, and rescaling a sentiment score the model
# answered on a 0-100 scale. None of them is specific to this model.
#
# **Do not put it on the analyst.** It chose from the candidate menu in 2 runs
# of 8 at its shipped sampling, against `gemma4:e4b-it-qat`'s 4 of 4. Choosing
# what to research is the whole analyst experiment, and that is a judgement
# failure rather than a format one, so none of the fixes above touches it. At
# temperature 1 it reached 4 of 4, but one of those researched 11 of the 15
# names, which is not a choice, and another named SPX, which was not on the
# menu.
#
# **Watch the prompt share if it goes on the live bot.** 74% against gemma4's
# 82-84% means it still reads less and talks more, and that ratio is what
# caught the fabrication in the first place. It is inside the healthy band and
# it has not moved.
#
# Sampling is what Liquid AI ships: temperature 0.2, top_k 80,
# repeat_penalty 1.05.
FROM lfm2.5:8b
PARAMETER num_ctx 128000
